               <code code="51727-6" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INACTIVE INGREDIENT SECTION"/>
               <title>
                  <content styleCode="italics">Inactive ingredients</content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>betadex, citric acid anhydrous, colloidal silicon dioxide, crospovidone, dl-alpha-tocopherol, hydroxypropyl cellulose, magnesium stearate, maize maltodextrin, mannitol, microcrystalline cellulose, natural flavourings, sodium bicarbonate, sodium starch glycolate and sucralose.<br/>
